{
    "title": "Muslim Prayer - Qibla Finder",
    "description": "Introducing the ultimate Muslim Prayer App, your digital companion for a deeper spiritual journey. Seamlessly blends innovation with tradition, offering features like prayer times, Qibla finder, Quran recitation, and daily reminders, all designed to enhance your faithful reminders & guidance.\r\n\r\nMain Feature of The Qibla finder & Islamic compass App: \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd4c Prayer times & location and Prayer Reminders: Stay connected to your faith with our accurate prayer times. Never miss a muslim prayer again, thanks to our accurate prayer times calculations based on your prayer location. Receive gentle prayer notifications, allowing you to find peace and tranquility in your prayer daily routine. Maintain a consistent prayer schedule and strengthen your connection with your faith Muslim.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd4b Compass & Qibla Finder: Easily find your spiritual location with our adaptable compass and map. Effortlessly guide yourself towards the Makkah location, ensuring your prayers are always accurately directed. Experience peace of mind, devotion & spiritual growth knowing you are aligned with the revered direction of Makkah.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcd6 The Holy Quran (Al Qur'an): Immerse yourself in the verbal beauty of the Quran daily with our translations, listen to soothing readings, and mark important pages with bookmarks. Enrich your spiritual journey and bring the Quran's muslim wisdom into your daily life.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\uddd3\ufe0f Muslim Hijri Calendar: Stay attuned to crucial Islamic calendar & hijri dates such as Eid-Ul-Fitr, Eid-Ul-Adha, Rabi'al Awwal, and more, ensuring you partake in every moment of celebration and significance.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcff Digital Tasbih Counter: Effortlessly participate in customizable dhikr times (remembrance of Allah) while on the move, thanks to this convenient prayer digital feature designed for your spiritual daily practice. No more beads, just simple, customizable dhikr digital on the go.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude4f Azkaz recitation prayer treasure: This feature gives you a list of prayers recitation and things to remember from the Hadiths and Quran recitation, making it easy to recite and read.\r\n\r\nWith technological prowess and devotion daily, this Qibla Finder - Muslim Prayer app is more than a prayer digital tool; it's a conduit that bridges the gap between your modern lifestyle and timeless spiritual digital practices.\r\n\r\nEmbrace the convenience, deepen your connection with your faith daily, and embark on a spiritual journey of growth with the Muslim Prayer App.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83d\uded1 Disclaimer:</b>\r\n- The content in the app, including Quran content, prayer times and other features, are provided in the hope that they will be useful but without any warranties\r\n- Please note that prayer times may not be accurate by some standards depending on geographic location.\r\n- This app is intended solely to provide information and does not make any religious decisions. We respect all religious beliefs.\r\n- To fully use the app's features, an Internet connection is required. Without an Internet connection, some features may not work, including downloading additional Qurans and using audio features. Ensure you always have an Internet connection for the best experience with the app. \r\n\r\nFor feedback, questions, or concerns, please contact us via email: support@technify.vn \r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://sites.google.com/view/technify-muslim-qibla-policy \r\nTerm of Service: https://sites.google.com/view/muslim-prayer-tos/home",
